' --- Diagrama: sequência Caminho B (PowerShell / PsDirect) ---
@startuml
title Sequência — Caminho B (PowerShell / PsDirect + SHA256)
autonumber
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor "Utilizador" as U
participant "WPF Desktop" as WPF
participant "04-Run-Sample.ps1" as PS
participant "Hyper-V host" as HV
participant "Guest VM" as GUEST
participant "Run-MalwareAnalysis.ps1" as ANALYSIS

U -> WPF : drag-and-drop +\nanálise dinâmica
WPF -> PS : invocar pipeline\n(credenciais guest)
PS -> HV : Restore-VMSnapshot CleanState
PS -> HV : Start-VM
PS -> GUEST : copiar amostra +\nscripts (PsDirect)

PS -> ANALYSIS : Invoke-Command\nRun-MalwareAnalysis.ps1
ANALYSIS -> ANALYSIS : monitorizar\nficheiros · registry · rede
' *Ficheiro de conclusão com hash SHA256*
ANALYSIS -> GUEST : gravar C:\analysis.txt\n+ guest_analysis_done.txt\n(SHA256)

loop PhaseE-WaitReport
  PS -> GUEST : polling guest_analysis_done.txt
end

PS -> GUEST : Copy-SandboxVMFileFromGuest\n(PsDirect ou Copy-VMFile)
GUEST --> PS : analysis_<RunId>.txt

' *Verificação de integridade antes de aceitar relatório*
PS -> PS : Assert-SandboxCopiedReportHash\n(comparar SHA256)
alt hash inválido
  PS -> PS : apagar ficheiro no host
  PS --> WPF : erro de integridade
else hash válido
  PS -> HV : Stop-VM + restore snapshot
  PS --> WPF : relatório + run JSON
  WPF -> WPF : publicar job na API\n(opcional: abrir browser)
end

@enduml
